{"2320070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Misfits", "steam_appid": 2320070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Misfits</strong> is a chaotic action-roguelike  with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>endlessly generated dungeons</strong> packed with danger, secrets, and over <strong>80 unique enemies</strong>, each demanding different tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320070/extras/bc5b79cf8c1b580acd0f887a53d52ff4.poster.avif?t=1779475911\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320070/extras/bc5b79cf8c1b580acd0f887a53d52ff4.webm?t=1779475911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with <strong>66 unique items</strong>, every single one rolling its own <strong>distinct traits</strong> from a pool of <strong>60 powerful modifiers</strong>, ensuring every build feels truly personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320070/extras/f1fa1a004919281f851dde46b487a6a3.poster.avif?t=1779475911\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320070/extras/f1fa1a004919281f851dde46b487a6a3.webm?t=1779475911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c